        70.86609649658203,
        240.94654846191406,
        527.4158935546875,
        256.6655578613281
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated guidelines. Module 4: Treatment and care This chapter of the   aims to provide a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.42250061035156,
        515.031982421875,
        269.8655090332031
      ],
      "text": "summary of existing WHO recommendations on care and support during tuberculosis treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.12652587890625,
        527.4409790039062,
        291.5695495605469
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations included in this chapter were developed by three Guidelines Development",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.05047607421875,
        524.4161987304688,
        304.7695007324219
      ],
      "text": "(1–3) Groups (GDGs) convened by the WHO Global Tuberculosis Programme in 2011, 2016 and 2021",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.991395950317383,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.41650390625,
        527.4202270507812,
        317.9695129394531
      ],
      "text": "Annex 7 in order to review the evidence available on key aspects of TB care and support (see  ). The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        316.72650146484375,
        446.7604675292969,
        331.1695251464844
      ],
      "text": "GDGs were composed of a multidisciplinary group of TB experts external to WHO.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.430419921875,
        527.132080078125,
        352.8734436035156
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations were formulated by the GDGs using the GRADE approach. The recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.6304016113281,
        527.4024658203125,
        366.07342529296875
      ],
      "text": "were then reviewed by external review groups which were composed of experts and end-users from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.8304138183594,
        148.64930725097656,
        379.2734375
      ],
      "text": "all WHO regions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.5343933105469,
        527.390380859375,
        400.9774169921875
      ],
      "text": "The Global TB Programme (GTB) of the World Health Organization (WHO) has been combining all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.73431396484375,
        527.573974609375,
        414.1773376464844
      ],
      "text": "current recommendations into one overall set of consolidated guidelines on TB. The guidelines contain",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957317352294922,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.9344177246094,
        527.5311889648438,
        427.37744140625
      ],
      "text": "recommendations regarding all areas related to the programmatic management of TB (e.g. screening,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970610618591309,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.1343994140625,
        527.407958984375,
        440.5774230957031
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment, diagnostics, the treatment of drug-susceptible and drug-resistant TB, patient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.3343200683594,
        527.6163940429688,
        453.77734375
      ],
      "text": "care and support). The consolidated guidelines contain modules specific to each programmatic area.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991395950317383,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.7622985839844,
        527.4207153320312,
        475.4813232421875
      ],
      "text": "(4) The consolidated WHO evidence-based guidelines for the treatment of drug-resistant TB  , for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.9623107910156,
        527.4343872070312,
        488.68133544921875
      ],
      "text": "(5) treatment of drug-susceptible TB (DS-TB)  , and for the management of tuberculosis in children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.16229248046875,
        527.40966796875,
        501.8813171386719
      ],
      "text": "(3) and adolescents   were published in 2020 and 2022. The recommendations on tuberculosis care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.6383056640625,
        527.4089965820312,
        515.081298828125
      ],
      "text": "and support contained in these guidelines were developed using the Grading of Recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.8383178710938,
        527.5430297851562,
        528.2813110351562
      ],
      "text": "Assessment, Development and Evaluation (GRADE) method for assessment of the quality of evidence.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976675033569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.542236328125,
        527.4388427734375,
        549.9852294921875
      ],
      "text": "People-centred care is an important element of the End TB Strategy which recommends treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.7421875,
        527.4879760742188,
        563.1851806640625
      ],
      "text": "and patient support for all people with TB. Several interventions to support patients in their adherence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9653959274292,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        561.9421997070312,
        527.4002075195312,
        576.3851928710938
      ],
      "text": "to TB treatment have been implemented by national TB programmes for many years (e.g. treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.1422119140625,
        527.426513671875,
        589.585205078125
      ],
      "text": "support with observation of medicine intake and social support), while others have been introduced",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.3422241210938,
        527.4354248046875,
        602.7852172851562
      ],
      "text": "recently (e.g. digital health interventions such as SMS messages, telephone calls or other reminders,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.542236328125,
        527.40771484375,
        615.9852294921875
      ],
      "text": "and video-supported treatment, or VST). These interventions and models of care have been assessed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980082511901855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.7421875,
        527.5505981445312,
        629.1851806640625
      ],
      "text": "using the GRADE method and WHO has issued guidelines with evidence-based recommendations for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971964836120605,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.9423217773438,
        527.3231811523438,
        642.3853149414062
      ],
      "text": "a variety of interventions for TB care and support. This chapter presents all WHO’s recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993998527526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.1422119140625,
        527.4508666992188,
        655.585205078125
      ],
      "text": "on TB care and support that are either newly developed or are existing recommendations that have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.3422241210938,
        471.0682373046875,
        668.7852172851562
      ],
      "text": "been published previously in other WHO guidelines that applied the GRADE approach.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
